{"id":"c4064bf070958ca9","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-randomness-layers.md","title":"有界前缀亏损的有效闭层","display":"df-randomness-layers — 有界前缀亏损的有效闭层","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-randomness-layers","aliases":["43-df-randomness-layers"],"display":"df-randomness-layers — 有界前缀亏损的有效闭层","depends_on":["[[43-df-prefixkolm]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_location":"§11.1, opening construction","source_printed_pages":"252","source_pdf_pages":"272","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-round3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-randomness-layers"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-randomness-layers</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-randomness-layers — 有界前缀亏损的有效闭层"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§11.1, opening construction"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"252"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"272"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(c\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a> 的固定通用前缀复杂度。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\upharpoonright n\">\\(X\\upharpoonright n\\)</span> 是长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的初段。下式引入集合族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal R_c)_{c\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((\\mathcal R_c)_{c\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_c:=\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;K(X\\upharpoonright n)+c\\ge n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R_c:=\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;K(X\\upharpoonright n)+c\\ge n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是书中第11章开头使用的随机点闭层。各层有效闭，所有层的并为Martin-Löf随机点类；本原子只定义层，不把这些性质充作定义。标准长度初段含空串，故不存在遗漏零长度的情况。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所供2007-07-28草稿，§11.1, opening construction；印刷页252，PDF页272。本轮逐项核对来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$c\\in\\mathbb N$；$K$ 采用 [[43-df-prefixkolm]] 的固定通用前缀复杂度。$X\\upharpoonright n$ 是长度为 $n$ 的初段。下式引入集合族 $(\\mathcal R_c)_{c\\in\\mathbb N}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"c\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"X\\upharpoonright n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathcal R_c)_{c\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_c:=\\{X\\in2^\\omega:\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;K(X\\upharpoonright n)+c\\ge n\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1454,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-282","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-randomness-layers]] — 有界前缀亏损的有效闭层"},{"id":"f6a5791a3d1f38c1","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\operatorname{HyperimmuneFree}$、$\\mathcal R_c$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-hyperimmune-free]]、[[43-df-randomness-layers]]；超免疫自由基定理与随机点复杂度刻画见 [[43-thm-hif-basis]]、[[43-thm-mlrandom-kolm]]。"},{"id":"07115caa7777627c","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\operatorname{Low}$、$\\mathcal R_c$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-low-high]]、[[43-df-randomness-layers]]；低基定理与随机点复杂度刻画见 [[43-thm-basisthm]]、[[43-thm-mlrandom-kolm]]。"}],"outgoing":["6cd902d852c2c848"]}